      "name": "Voidborn Resilience",
      "description": "Every second in champion combat grants +2 armor and magic resist (up to 8 stacks). At 8 stacks you drain enemies within 700 for 80 + 7% bonus health magic damage, healing that much per champion drained, and your bonus armor and magic resist rise by 20% until combat ends.",
